OL,5,G0000 Freak Zone Playlist
OL,6,     FMusician and composer Rosie Turton
OL,7,     Faka Nomieye picks an hour of
OL,8,     F'ambient brass' music.
OL,9,G0100 My Top Twelve: Paul Weller
OL,10,     FIn this 1982 broadcast, Paul
OL,11,     FWeller joins host Andy Peebles to
OL,12,     Fshare a playlist of 12 defining
OL,13,     Ftracks, diving into the soul and
OL,14,     Fpunk roots that inspired his
OL,15,     Fhistoric songcraft.
OL,16,G0200 My Top Twelve: Jackie Wilson
OL,17,     FSoul legend Jackie Wilson joins
OL,18,     Fhost Brian Matthew to share 12
OL,19,     Fdefining tracks, discussing the
OL,20,     Fmonumental vocal and rhythm roots
OL,21,     Fthat built his historic career.
